  "body": "**Description**\r\n\r\nAdds support for UE 5.4.\r\n\r\nThis also improves one of the error messages related to Luas UScriptStruct implementation, which turned out to be useful when diagnosing why UE4SS wasn't working in 5.4.\r\n\r\n**Type of change**\r\n\r\n- [x] New feature (non-breaking change which adds functionality)\r\n\r\n**Checklist**\r\n\r\nPlease delete options that are not relevant. Update the list as the PR progresses.\r\n\r\n- [x] Any dependent changes have been merged and published in downstream modules.\r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n\r\nRequires https://github.com/Re-UE4SS/UEPseudo/pull/90.\r\nSee #502 for status updates.\r\nThis is currently blocked until we test BP mods.\r\n",
